  "body": "I think once #4350 lands we should remove everything before \"discard\" in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#garbage-collection-and-browsing-contexts. And we should also remove https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#garbage-collection.\r\n\r\nThe \"modern\" way of doing this is by keeping references in slots and all references are strong. If there's an actual non-strong reference this would have to be called out explicitly and defined.",
